id":"anomalies:BARR_BASE_CAT","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"荒芜平原","en":"On the Barren Plains"},"texts":[{"zh":"粗略扫描显示，行星表面有一个不断向茫茫太空发射的脉冲信号。","en":"A cursory scan of the planet's surface reveals a weak signal pulsing into the darkness of space."}],"sections":[{"zh":"粗略扫描显示，行星表面有一个不断向茫茫太空发射的脉冲信号。","en":"A cursory scan of the planet's surface reveals a weak signal pulsing into the darkness of space."}],"image":"art/da16f4709ed6d556eed9.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"anomaly.185","kind":"research","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/01_anomaly_categories.txt:487","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-barr-base-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/01_anomaly_categories.txt","line":468}},{"id":"anomaly.185","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生死弥留","en":"Limbo"},"texts":[{"zh":"信号似乎是从某个类似信号天线的结构中传来的。我方已经从[Root.GetName]发射了探索无人机，希望能够在星球表面发现更多线索。\n\n科学专员[Root.GetLeaderName]所发现的洞穴仓库十分容易地就被撬开。他判定这座仓库为某种早已灭亡的外星种族所用，似乎是其族群最后的一处避难所。该种族的科技水平虽然较为先进，但似乎从未进行太空探索，结果因为某种涉及到整颗星球的自然灾害而消亡了。库房面积广大，其中充斥着成千上万个黑匣子。据[Root.GetName]判定，这些匣子都是数据储存装置。\n\n已发起特殊项目来进一步对这些匣子进行解读。","en":"The signal originates from the remains of an antenna-like structure. Exploratory probes were dispatched from the [Root.GetName] to the surface to investigate the matter more closely.\n\nWhat Science Officer [Root.GetLeaderName] found was a cavernous vault that, while easily pried open, was evidently the last safehouse and refuge of some long-dead race of aliens. While reasonably technologically advanced, it seems they never reached for the stars and perished to some planet-wide natural disaster. The vault is immense, housing thousands upon thousands of black boxes that the [Root.GetName] has determined to be data storage devices.\n\nA Special Project has been prepared to decode their contents."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/445099ae48e90f59ec44.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:LIMBO_1_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt:5028","story":"anomaly-barr-base-cat"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":5014},"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"},"Root.GetLeaderName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"}}},{"id":"special_projects:LIMBO_1_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"生死弥留","en":"In Limbo"},"texts":[{"zh":"一个满载着各种数据存储设备的外星避难所，亟待考古学家恢复数据。","en":"An alien vault filled with data storage devices practically begs for some archaeological data recovery."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/602eb656c2e9a341b17b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"anomaly.186","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_2.txt:327","hooks":["on_success"],"sets":["machine_age_virtuality_studied"],"story":"anomaly-barr-base-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_2.txt","line":310}},{"id":"anomaly.186","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生死弥留","en":"Limbo"},"texts":[{"zh":"此次发现的避难所原来是一个希望永生的物种的大型坟墓。\n\n科学专员[Root.GetLeaderName]判定，这些巨大的匣子中所充满的三进制编码，实际上是神经网路投影、数据化的脑部扫描结果。毫无疑问，[From.From.GetName]的异星物种认为这是他们在星球毁灭前唯一的存活方法。虽然他们无法拯救自己，但心中仍然希望着或许有一天，其它物种可以使用这些数据来复活他们。","en":"The vault is a tomb for hopeful immortals.\n\nScience Officer [Root.GetLeaderName] asserts that the huge blocks of ternary code found in the databanks are neural images - digitized brain scans. Doubtless the aliens of [From.From.GetName] considered this their only shot at any kind of survival, following whatever calamity befell their planet. They did not have the means to resurrect themselves, but banked on the impossibly small hope that eventually, someone else would have those means."},{"zh":"此次发现的避难所原来是一个希望永生的物种的大型坟墓。\n\n数据库中发现的大量三进制编码，实际上是神经网路投影、数据化的脑部扫描结果。毫无疑问，[From.From.GetName]的异星物种认为这是他们在星球毁灭前唯一的存活方法。虽然他们没有复活自己的技术，但仍然抱着终有一天会有其他文明帮他们做到的微小希望。\n\n考虑到我们高度发达的机器人技术，研究员们确信我们的机器人拥有承载这种高等智慧的精密度。","en":"The vault is a tomb for hopeful immortals.\n\nThe huge blocks of ternary code found in the databanks are neural images - digitized brain scans. Doubtless the aliens of [From.From.GetName] considered this to be their only shot at survival, following whatever calamity befell their planet. Lacking the means to resurrect themselves, they banked on the small hope that eventually, someone else would.\n\nWith our expertise in the field of advanced robotics, researchers are confident that our robots are sophisticated enough to support a higher intelligence."},{"zh":"此次发现的避难所原来是一个希望永生的物种的大型坟墓。\n\n这些数据库中充满了大段的三进制编码，其中储存着的是他们的生物中央处理单元。[From.From.GetName]的异星物种似乎认为这是他们唯一的幸存方法。虽然他们无法拯救自己，但仍希望着其它物种或许可以做到。\n\n我们可以将这些神经扫描结果传输到我们的机器人身躯中，但这样的实验是很难预料其结果的。","en":"The vault is a tomb for hopeful immortals.\n\nWithin its databanks lie massive blocks of ternary code, housing digitized scans of their biological central processing units. The aliens of [From.From.GetName] likely saw this as their only chance for survival. Unable to resurrect themselves, they hoped that someone else would.\n\nWe can transfer these neural scans into robotic bodies like ours, but the results of such an experiment are difficult to predict."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/602eb656c2e9a341b17b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.186.a","label":{"zh":"还是不要打扰死者了吧。","en":"Let dead aliens lie."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"story.5","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt:5088","story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"anomaly.186.b","label":{"zh":"将神经模式下载到我们的数据库。","en":"Download the neural patterns for safekeeping."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_synthetic_fertility","value":fa